      "source": [
        "\n",
        "### Data subsampling\n",
        "\n",
        "Subsample the data so that you have a smaller dataset.\n",
        "1. Select a set of questions\n",
        "2. Select the queries as questions from the previous set having at least 1 positive duplicate\n",
        "3. **Be sure that the ``qid`` of the selected questions are not part of the set of questions that will be indexed in the k-NN for the retriever**"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "hEbB-b1-a7aY"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "*Note: on prend 10000 questions qui seront notre vecteur DB, on peut pas avor des duplicats.*\n",
        "\n",
        "*on veut aucune intersection entre query (Q) et vecteur DB (C) (sinon ça marchera tjrs).*"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "5Z1QhbQbbpm7"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "potential_queries_indices = resample(df_labels.loc[df_labels['is_duplicate'] == 1, 'qid1'].unique(),replace=False, n_samples=1000)\n",
        "# 1000 id de qid1 où is_duplicate = 1 (resample : sélectionne au hasard)\n",
        "# query_indices = seront utilisés comme questions de test (ou requêtes) pour voir si le système de recherche peut trouver leur duplicat.\n",
        "\n",
        "correct_outputs = df_labels.loc[(df_labels['is_duplicate'] == 1)&(df_labels['qid1'].isin(potential_queries_indices)), 'qid2'].unique()\n",
        "# = ensemble d'identifiants qid2 associés aux questions dans query_indices\n",
        "# <=> chaque élément dans correct_outputs est une réponse correcte pour la question correspondante dans query_indices"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "1pzb1t3-MgdF"
      },
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "len(correct_outputs) # 1665"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "DanX_zYyMgZQ",
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "outputId": "80035481-4239-442a-cbb4-a8fc73c57557"
      },
      "execution_count": null,
